  "description": "*From [Tappytoon](https://www.tappytoon.com/en/book/meatliberation/):*    \nEating meat is banned as the moment you do, you die a horrible death in this unbelievable world. To set their dinner tables right, a few school friends form the ‘Meat Up Liberation Union’. Can Doil and the meat-loving crew get to the bottom of this ironic and strange banishment in one piece?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/50151034), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=2844732), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/4343000229), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/please_let_me_eat_meat)",
